Package: folio
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cosmoe, attr, hicolor-icon-theme, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: notebooks in Markdown with links that follow renames
 Folio keeps notebooks of Markdown pages whose links follow a page when it is
 renamed or moved, with backlinks for each page. A Hokku app.
